---
// src/components/landing/CourseCatalog.astro
---
<section id="courses" class="courses section bg-light py-5">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-title text-center mb-5" data-aos="fade-up">
      <h2 class="fw-bold">Nos Parcours de Soin & Ateliers de groupe</h2>
      <p class="text-muted">Des protocoles structurés basés sur les thérapies cognitives et comportementales.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="row gy-4">
      
      <!-- ATELIER 1 : LE STRESS -->
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="100">
        <div class="course-card shadow-sm rounded-4 overflow-hidden bg-white h-100 border-0 position-relative">
          <div class="course-badge px-3 py-1 bg-primary text-white position-absolute mt-3 ms-3 rounded-pill small">Disponible</div>
          
          <img 
            src="/assets/img/formation-comprendre-le-stress.png" 
            alt="Atelier de groupe Mieux comprendre le Stress" 
            class="img-fluid"
            style="height: 220px; object-fit: cover; width: 100%;"
          />

          <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column" style="height: calc(100% - 220px);">
            <h4 class="fw-bold">Mieux comprendre le Stress</h4>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-4">Un programme complet pour comprendre ses mécanismes biologiques, désamorcer les freins et reprendre le contrôle par la TCC.</p>
            <hr class="mt-auto">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center pt-2">
              <span class="fw-bold text-primary small">Cycle de 5 modules</span>
              <a href="/formations/comprendre-le-stress" class="btn btn-outline-primary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3">Découvrir le programme</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ATELIER 2 : LE BURNOUT (NOUVEAU CYCLE) -->
      <div class="col-lg-6 col-xl-6" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="200">
        <div class="course-card shadow-sm rounded-4 overflow-hidden bg-white h-100 border-0 position-relative">
          <div class="course-badge px-3 py-1 bg-primary text-white position-absolute mt-3 ms-3 rounded-pill small">Nouveau</div>
          
          <img 
            src="/assets/img/image-burnout-binche.jpg" 
            alt="Atelier de groupe Réellement comprendre et surmonter le Burnout" 
            class="img-fluid"
            style="height: 220px; object-fit: cover; width: 100%;"
          />

          <div class="p-4 d-flex flex-column" style="height: calc(100% - 220px);">
            <h4 class="fw-bold">Comprendre et surmonter le Burnout</h4>
            <p class="text-muted small mb-4">Désamorcer l'épuisement, stopper les ruminations toxiques, sortir de l'hypercontrôle et sécuriser la reprise professionnelle.</p>
            <hr class="mt-auto">
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center pt-2">
              <span class="fw-bold text-primary small">Cycle de 5 modules</span>
              <a href="/formations/burnout" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm rounded-pill px-3">Découvrir le programme</a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

<!-- FORMATION 3 : TROUBLE ANXIÉTÉ GÉNÉRALISÉE (TAG) -->
          <div class="card shadow-lg border-0 mb-5" style="border-radius: 20px; overflow: hidden; background: #fff;">
            <!-- BANNIÈRE IMAGE -->
            <div style="width: 100%; height: 220px; overflow: hidden;">
              <img 
                src="/assets/img/anxiete-generalisee-tag-binche.jpg" 
                alt="Formation Anxiété Généralisée (TAG) Binche" 
                style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center;"
              >
            </div>

            <div class="card-body p-4 p-md-5">
              <div class="row gy-4 align-items-center">
                
                <div class="col-lg-7">
                  <span class="badge mb-2" style="background-color: var(--accent-color); color: white; padding: 8px 15px; border-radius: 50px;">Prochaine session · Binche</span>
                  <h2 class="mb-3" style="color: #222; font-weight: 700;">Apprivoiser l'anxiété généralisée (TAG) par les TCC</h2>
                  
                  <p class="text-muted">
                    Inquiétudes excessives, ruminations incessantes, tension corporelle permanente : apprenez à rompre le cercle vicieux de l'intolérance à l'incertitude grâce aux outils concrets de la thérapie cognitive et comportementale.
                  </p>
                  
                  <a href="https://psyhainaut.be/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="agrement-card d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row align-items-center p-3 mt-4" style="background-color: #6f42c1; color: white; border-radius: 12px; text-decoration: none; transition: 0.3s; box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(102, 16, 242, 0.2);">
                    <div class="d-flex align-items-center mb-3 mb-sm-0 w-100 w-sm-auto">
                      <div class="me-3 fs-4">
                        <i class="bi bi-shield-check"></i>
                      </div>
                      <div class="flex-grow-1">
                        <strong style="color: white;">Agrément Officiel :</strong><br>
                        <span style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); font-size: 0.9rem;">Programme éligible au remboursement PsyHainaut.</span>
                      </div>
                    </div>

                    <div class="ms-sm-3 ps-sm-3 border-sm-start border-white-50 mt-3 mt-sm-0">
                      <img src="/assets/img/Logo-Mosaique.png" alt="Logo PsyHainaut" style="height: 50px; max-width: 100%; object-fit: contain;">
                    </div>
                  </a>

                  <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-sm-row gap-2 mt-4">
                    <a href="/formations/tag" class="btn btn-outline-secondary flex-fill" style="border-radius: 50px; padding: 12px; font-weight: 600;">
                      Découvrir le programme
                    </a>
                    <a href="/formations/tag/sessions/binche" class="btn flex-fill" style="background: var(--accent-color); color: white; border-radius: 50px; padding: 12px; font-weight: 600; transition: 0.3s;">
                      S'inscrire à cette session
                    </a>
                  </div>
                </div>

                <div class="col-lg-5">
                  <div class="text-center p-4" style="background: #fdfdfd; border: 1px solid #f0f0f0; border-radius: 20px;">
                    <h5 class="mb-4" style="font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #555;">Vos Intervenants</h5>
                    
                    <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-4">
                      
                      <div class="d-flex align-items-center text-start p-2" style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
                        <img src="/assets/img/team/michael-plichart.jpg" alt="Michaël Plichart" style="width: 75px; height: 75px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 3px solid var(--accent-color);">
                        <div class="ms-3">
                          <h6 class="mb-0" style="font-weight: 700;">Michaël Plichart</h6>
                          <small class="text-muted">Psychologue & Formateur</small>
                        </div>
                      </div>

                      <div class="d-flex align-items-center text-start p-2" style="background: white; border-radius: 12px; box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.03);">
                        <img src="/assets/img/team/celine-mahieu.jpg" alt="Céline Mahieu" style="width: 75px; height: 75px; border-radius: 50%; object-fit: cover; border: 3px solid var(--accent-color);">
                        <div class="ms-3">
                          <h6 class="mb-0" style="font-weight: 700;">Céline Mahieu</h6>
                          <small class="text-muted">Psychothérapeute TCC</small>
                        </div>
                      </div>

                    </div>

                    <p class="mt-4 small text-muted italic">
                      <em>"Apprendre à pêcher plutôt que de recevoir un poisson."</em>
                    </p>
                  </div>
                </div>

              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

      <!-- EN PRÉPARATION : TOC -->
      <div class="col-lg-6" data-aos="zoom-in" data-aos-delay="400">
        <div class="course-card shadow-sm rounded-4 overflow-hidden bg-white h-100 border-0 opacity-75 position-relative">
          <div class="course-badge px-3 py-1 bg-secondary text-white position-absolute mt-3 ms-3 rounded-pill small">Prochainement</div>
          <div class="placeholder-img bg-light d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center" style="height: 160px;">
            <i class="bi bi-gear-wide-connected fs-2 text-muted"></i>
          </div>
          <div class="p-4">
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-muted">Protocoles TOC</h5>
            <p class="text-muted small">Désamorcer les rituels et les pensées intrusives par l'exposition avec prévention de la réponse (EPR).</p>
            <hr>
            <div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center">
              <span class="text-muted small fst-italic">En préparation</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .course-card { 
    transition: all 0.3s ease; 
  }
  .course-card:hover { 
    transform: translateY(-8px); 
  }
  .course-badge { 
    z-index: 10; 
    font-size: 11px; 
    font-weight: 700; 
    text-transform: uppercase; 
  }
</style>